**Mapper: `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** — MapStruct mapper; `toOwner(OwnerFieldsDto)` ignores `id` and `pets`.

## 3. Owner entity + request DTO

The request body class is **`OwnerFieldsDto`** (there is no `OwnerRequest` class). It is **generated at build time** by the openapi-generator-maven-plugin from `openapi.yml` (package `org.springframework.samples.petclinic.rest.dto`, suffix `Dto`), so no `.java` source file exists in the tree yet.

**Schema in `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/resources/openapi.yml` (lines 1991-2039):**
```yaml
